00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:19.400
[George] The administration's response was swift, ruthless, and total.

66
00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:33.320
[George] Cleveland's advisers and cabinet secretaries launched an aggressive smear campaign against Edwards, publicly branding him a disreputable liar and a gutter journalist who was inventing sensational fables to panic Wall Street.

67
00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:34.120
