69
00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:43.800
[George] Edwards' journalistic reputation was ruined.

70
00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:48.280
[George] He was ostracized by colleagues and hounded out of the Washington press corps.

71
00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:53.400
[George] Cleveland went on to live another 15 years, completely free of cancer.

72
00:06:53.400 --> 00:07:00.440
[George] It was not until 1917, 24 years later, and nine years after Cleveland's death, that Dr.

